    {
      "kind": "draft_claim",
      "id": "draft-claim-draft-432b11b1-c704-4170-a352-446cb6064878-r2-1",
      "text": "林默走进北门。",
      "sha256": "e4176f286a3ddb9f942263869e400c8c74ea13a68e2dbcbe3ed73505c7823393"
    },
    {
      "kind": "draft_claim",
      "id": "draft-claim-draft-432b11b1-c704-4170-a352-446cb6064878-r2-2",
      "text": "林默走进北门。",
      "sha256": "e4176f286a3ddb9f942263869e400c8c74ea13a68e2dbcbe3ed73505c7823393"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-62ae7d78-95f9-41d5-8297-234791dd5ca7",
      "chapter_id": "ch-c3588b7b-3b49-4abd-8a6d-241a7829e72e",
      "chapter_number": 6,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "电台在二十一点零五分收到三次短促求救码，信号来自雾线水门以外。",
      "sha256": "2d354cc208c312f81f0d4d72c682603571b1edd1bfaf6bcf3561e4e04a22dc6a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-77b2fe59-b0b0-498f-acfc-3115ae14df94",
      "chapter_id": "ch-41ffacf7-1c87-4a84-b493-428eac182810",
      "chapter_number": 10,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "北潮闸并未关闭，雾钟却响了一次；温岚仍握着罗盘，港外传来白色渡船的汽笛。",
      "sha256": "183759380df3c5c073ba0256d25ae7426cb03fc193282a5f791b26586f45103b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-01df0d99-a5c7-4a55-883b-066c998b4f23",
      "chapter_id": "ch-8541970a-0ec2-46ab-bf31-39197749918c",
      "chapter_number": 9,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "进入仓道前，苏岑把带月牙裂纹的黄铜罗盘交到温岚手里保管。",
      "sha256": "c118f3d296dfb8d143c3b0b5467637a24e73f833356f845d5d5c7596956d88a5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-51beec8f-e734-4e3f-bd17-de04b9283a84",
      "chapter_id": "ch-c4e513e4-3460-4af0-9596-6fccf03a99d4",
      "chapter_number": 8,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "温岚把北堤值守簿交给苏岑，两人约定不再各自隐瞒新线索。",
      "sha256": "356f1372376d61df6ed9af380f9c17ca332b58e5d8e09396df79e419eb5fd18a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-34d22780-d49a-40b8-9e9c-5b5b136b1042",
      "source_span_id": "span-62ae7d78-95f9-41d5-8297-234791dd5ca7",
      "text": "第6章 21:05 收到三次求救码",
      "sha256": "7556dfa1c21c2596152b98090557914768c4a70b2db0c1c03ce3d6a93349e316"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-4d12166c-bccc-4728-a051-f7e0b7614087",
      "source_span_id": "span-db9fd9ec-7913-4106-8faa-201d19f2c7ed",
      "text": "没有靠岸，来源未明",
      "sha256": "79fd506cc2927825ff3684e1a00e8fa6f5e8e841cc8d31f5cd4f5f81b1f23b1b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-6cb41d9d-983c-4326-bb3f-1743e217b4ab",
      "source_span_id": "span-c72015f2-4ca4-4b95-baed-10b85308c309",
      "text": "雾线水门外锚柱",
      "sha256": "364a41b7ccb226b487b22c1ca8c19df403c7d951678a34979003acf57e4a072e"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
